Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A Canadian inspector climbs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}up to count some {\c&H006DDCFF&}barrels{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}One shifts under his foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}What the hell was supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}to be in that barrel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}for a single wobble to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}kick off an eighteen-million-dollar investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Quebec, twenty twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}This place holds a strategic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}reserve of maple {\c&H006DDCFF&}syrup{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Your mum has a strategic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}reserve too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}It’s the good jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Touch it and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Here’s the logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Nobody got the fucking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:30.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}trees to sign a supply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}contract. One year there’s
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:34.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}sap everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Sorry, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}I’m a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}So they store the surplus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Rows and rows of identical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}barrels{\r}. The paperwork
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}looks immaculate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Barrel here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:52.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Yep. Another barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Yep. Now try doing an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}inventory of what the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}isn’t in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The thieves got roughly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:00:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}three thousand tonnes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:00.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}of {\c&H006DDCFF&}syrup{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Some {\c&H006DDCFF&}barrels{\r} were empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Others held {\c&H006DDCFF&}water{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine writing the tasting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}notes. Crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Delicate on the tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Lingering notes of felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The haul was worth about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.71,0:01:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}eighteen million Canadian
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.79,0:01:19.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}dollars. After most heists
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}you change the locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:22.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}These guys also need somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}who can tell breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}from fucking plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:26.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Now when a diner serves
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}two pancakes with a single
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}drop of {\c&H006DDCFF&}syrup{\r},
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:31.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Are they being generous,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}or did Accounting finally
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}approve the withdrawal?
